  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">오목거울과 볼록거울의 사이즈가 콩알(?)만 하다고 평소, 학생들이 불편함을 호소하였습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">과학실 벽에 초대형 거울을 붙여두고 싶었으나, 아쉬운대로 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">650mm*250mm*700mm</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">사이즈의 거울을 구입하였습니다. </span></p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p></span><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">학생들의 반응, 괜찮습니다. ^^ 오며 가며 자신들의 모습을 비추어보네요.&nbsp;자연스레 거울의 원리를 익힐 수 있을 것 같아요.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">양면 거울이어서 일주일은 볼록,&nbsp;다음 일주일은 오목&nbsp;순으로 돌려놓으려 합니다.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9909E54B5AE188273C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"오목거울.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_9909E54B5AE188273CF30C\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F5D64D5AE1883736\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"볼록거울.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_99F5D64D5AE1883736C02E\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p></span><p><br></p><p><br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
